# Local bin scripts

Scripts under `bin/` seed demos, drive CCD events, and manage the local CFTLib stack. Most print
usage when run with no arguments or `-h` / `--help`.

How-to walkthroughs also live in the repository README. This page is the inventory of every
script in `bin/`.

## Stack lifecycle

| Script | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `bin/stop-boot-with-ccd.sh` | Stop bootWithCCD Java processes, local stubs/proxies, design/tech docs servers, and CFTLib Docker containers; free required ports |
| `bin/restart-boot-with-ccd.sh` | Stop then start `./gradlew bootWithCCD` again |
| `bin/start-design-docs.sh` | Middleman design docs on **:4567** (also started by `bootWithCCD`) |
| `bin/start-tech-docs.sh` | Middleman tech docs on **:4568** (also started by `bootWithCCD`) |
| `bin/start-local-dm-store.sh` | Start `bin/local-dm-store-stub.py` on **:4506** for Case Document AM uploads |
| `bin/local-dm-store-stub.py` | Minimal dm-store stub; persists binaries under `bin/.local-dm-store-data/` |
| `bin/start-xui-manage-batches-proxy.sh` | Reverse-proxy Manage Cases on **:3000** → XUI on **:3002** (Upload batch file nav + CaseLinkingReasonCode LOV stub) |
| `bin/restart-xui-manage-batches-proxy.sh` | Restart the nav proxy only |
| `bin/xui-manage-batches-proxy.py` | Implementation of the nav / LOV proxy (started by the scripts above) |
| `bin/fix-linked-case-reasons.sh` | Restart the nav proxy and print steps so ExUI Linked Cases **Reasons** resolve `CLRC007` |

See also [ExUI primary navigation](/exui-navigation.html).

